| --------------- | ------------: |
| Swoole          | \${rb_swoole} |
| lxc             | \${rb_lxc} |
| WavPack         | \${rb_wavpack} |
| flex            | \${rb_flex} |
| p11-kit         | \${rb_p11} |
| x264            | \${rb_x264} |
| recutils-1.8    | \${rb_recutils} |
| inetutils-1.9.4 | \${rb_inetutils} |
| snort-2.9.13    | \${rb_snort} |
| grub            | \${rb_grub} |
| **Total**       | **\${total}** |

EOT
EOS
chmod +x /home/run_table3.sh"

